merged.untrustedBody:
The RaC1 save import in include/save.h and docs/game/community-engine-reference.md named the wrong weapons (Pyrocitor, Blaster, Glove of Doom, Suck Cannon) and called block 10 a bitmask.

What the code does (func_00298F00 states 24-27, func_002FAE68, func_002FADB0):

- reads BASCUS-97199RATCHET, BESCES-50916RATCHET and BISCPS-15037RATCHET save0-4.bin (0x2800 bytes each) on each card;
- block 10 is a byte per RaC1 item id; items 0x0A, 0x12, 0x19, 0x0D, 0x13 (Bomb Glove, Walloper, Decoy Glove, Visibomb Gun, Tesla Claw) set bits 0-4 of D_001A7A00[8], and a good save sets bit 7;
- the vendor makes RaC2 items 12, 53, 17, 14, 18 (the same five) free.

Header comments and unused macros only; nothing includes save.h, so no object changes.

